We have collected some interesting facts about the game and its development and are in a hurry to share them with you!

[olist]
[*] [b]Tom and Sam’s prototypes[/b] are our real cats with similar names. They have a lot in common: appearance, relationship, character and they are also brothers too like these two cats;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35940776/6dfbfffc792c8b1c599f07916968b8c4fac93124.png[/img]

[*] The bags under [b]Yakov's eyes[/b] are a consequence of his sensitive sleep;

[*] [b]Helga's blue hair[/b] color and her smoking are a tribute to Chloe Price (Life is Strange) and a [b]mechanic[/b] of moving around locations is inspired by Nancy Drew series;

[*] In the male dormitory [b]Oliver’s bed[/b] is always half made up. In fact, he  makes it carefully but someone of the squad constantly mess with it;

[*] We, the developers of GP, are the [b]real twins[/b], so we have identical tastes, views and ideas about good games. However, it does not save us from disputes as they always lead to the best results;

[*] [b]Lien's “airtime”[/b] is shorter than Nemo’s intentionally;

[*] [b]The topic of religion[/b] will be touched in the game, but it does not reflect the developers' point of view and the situation in the real world;

[*] [b]Easter eggs[/b] are planned in the game.
[/olist]

[i]Thank you for attention!

Nozori Games[/i]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35940776/1d76b377578a6618baad34ddaafab1dbb842c1ba.png[/img]

[i][b]Merry Christmas and Happy New Year![/b][/i]

2019 was an important year and taught us a lot. We are very grateful to these kind people who  help us to share the word.

[b]Key events and the totals of 2019:[/b]
[list]
[*] The demo release on Steam, Itch, GameJolt;
[*] Demo updates (2 times);
[*] 3200+ downloads;
[*] Fan arts and moral support;
[*] Many solved problems (organizational and technical);
[*] Constant work on the project and our skills.
[/list]

In general, we are pleased with the results of the year although much remains to be done. With your active support our inspiration will last for a long time! Thank you for staying with us and following the development of GP!

And don’t forget to add Guilty Parade to your Wishlist!

[b][i]See you in 2020![/i][/b]
